    "featureForm": "passive",
    "description": "<p>The @Lookup[@name]'s carapace is coated in a corrosive acid that pits and rusts metal. When a PC within Melee range of the Rust Easter succeeds on an attack against it with a metal weapon, reduce the weapon's damage die by one step (for example, <strong>d8</strong> to <strong>d6</strong> or <strong>d6</strong> to <strong>d4</strong>). If a weapon's damage die is reduced below a <strong>d4</strong>, the weapon crumbles into rust. The @Lookup[@name] then devours the rust pile and clears a HP.</p>",
